  "text": "Settings\n\nPersonalize your launcher. Game settings belong to each instance.\n\nAppearance\nHome & Widgets\nLauncher\nMinecraft & Java\nUpdates\nDiscord & privacy\nAccessibility\nAbout\nHome & Widgets\n\nArrange widgets directly on Home.\n\nWidget visibility\n\nHiding a widget keeps its position and size for when you turn it back on.\n\nInstance Details\nInstalled Minecraft, platform and current Aurora content state.\nOn\nContent Summary\nLocal enabled/disabled mod and pack counts. No provider network requests.\nOn\nSession\nThe selected instance's latest process state in this launcher session. Not a saved play history.\nOff\nPlaytime\nLocal UTC playtime totals and daily history.\nOn\nRecent Worlds\nRecently played local worlds and validated Quick Launch.\nOn\nRecent Servers\nRecently played servers and validated Quick Launch.\nOn\nSkin Library\nCurrent account skin and your saved, reusable imported skins.\nOn\nCape Selector\nCurrent account cape, owned count and access to the cape library.\nOn\nArrange on Home\nReorder and resize widgets in the existing Home editor. Your layout stays saved between sessions.\nEdit Home\nReset widget layout\nRestore default visibility, order and sizes. Your worlds, play history and appearance library stay as they are.\nReset layout…\nPreferences save as you change them. Game configuration uses Save changes in the instance workspace.",
